 "description": "Food-derived medium: metabolizable components of Sea-buckthornberry (Hippophae rhamnoides) [Fruits] from FooDB, plus a standard M9 mineral base. Organic components use presence-based uptake bounds; FooDB content retained. Measured compounds with no BiGG exchange are listed under uncovered.",
